## ⭐ High-Value Customer Analysis

A dedicated analysis identifies customers based on **high revenue contribution and lower refund activity**.

The dashboard uses:

* Top 10 Limit Parameter
* Revenue ranking — Descending
* Refund ranking — Ascending
* Interactive Top 10 filtering

This allows the analysis to move beyond simply identifying high-revenue customers and instead focus on customers demonstrating stronger overall financial value.

---

